    "html_content_VxgQ8G": {
      "type": "html_content",
      "name": "Custom HTML",
      "settings": {
        "css_class": "remark-box",
        "html_content": "<div class=\"disclaimers-container\">\n    <div class=\"title  common-wrapper\">Disclaimers</div>\n    <div class=\"remark  common-wrapper\">\n        <p>*Unless specified, comparisons are to our previous products, with data up to release date.</p>\n        <p>*Creative materials are for advertising purposes only. Please refer to the actual product.</p>\n        <p>*The illustrations in this manual and material are for reference only. Product dimensions may vary by up to\n            2mm, and actual weight may vary slightly. Please refer to the actual product.</p>\n        <p>*Appearance may vary due to batch differences. Please refer to the actual item received.</p>\n        <p>*Robot vacuum chassis color may vary due to batch differences. Please refer to the actual item received.</p>\n        <p>*35,000Pa: Based on our in-house lab data. Actual performance may vary.</p>\n        <p>*75% higher suction: Compared to Dreame X50 Ultra. Based on our in-house lab data. Actual performance may\n            vary.</p>\n        <p>*100% particle pickup, 100% hair removal: In vacuuming mode under max suction settings, the hair pickup rate\n            on the floor can reach up to 100% and the pickup rate on both floors and carpets can reach up to 100%. Based\n            on our in-house lab data. Actual performance may vary.</p>\n        <p>*0% tangling side brush, 0% tangling DuoBrush, 0% tangled hair: Certified by TÜV SÜD. Actual results depend\n            on the environment.</p>\n        <p>*10.5mm: The height difference between the ground and the mop pads when lifted. Based on our in-house lab\n            data. Actual performance may vary by up to 0.5mm.</p>\n        <p>*Carpet boost: Once the carpet is detected, the robot vacuum will clean with maximum suction power. Not\n            available under Quiet Suction Mode. Both modes can be set through the cleaning app.</p>\n        <p>*Intensive carpet cleaning: After setting, the robot vacuum will properly slow the speed and clean the carpet\n            twice.</p>\n        <p>*100% coverage of edges and corners: Certified by TÜV SÜD. Actual results depend on the environment.</p>\n        <p>*0mm: Based on our in-house lab data. Actual performance may vary.</p>\n        <p>*100°C: Temperatures above the PTC system of the washboard can reach 100°C after heating under ambient room\n            temperature conditions (around 23°C), based on our in-house lab data. Actual temperature may vary.</p>\n        <p>*After the 100°C mop self-cleaning routine, the washboard's PTC system temperature drops to a safe\n            temperature, ensuring family safety.</p>\n        <p>*99.99%: 100°C hot water proves to kill 99.99% E. coli and inactivate 99.99% influenza A virus H1N1 under lab\n            testing conditions, sourced from the SGS IBR Laboratories (Report No. SHFT260400023971). Actual performance\n            may vary.</p>\n        <p>*280+ types of objects, 1.8cm: Based on our in-house lab data. Actual performance may vary.</p>\n        <p>*8.9cm: With a 8.9cm slim body, the robot vacuum requires a minimum entry height of 9.1cm. Please ensure\n            furniture bottoms are flat and free of protrusions. Based on our in-house lab data. Actual performance may\n            vary.</p>\n        <p>*Smart dirt detection: Available under CleanGenius Mode in the cleaning app.</p>\n        <p>*4cm, 2.2cm, 1.8cm: 4cm refers to the height of the double-layer step, and the gap between the two layers\n            should be greater than 4cm. For a single-layer vertical step, the highest crossing height is 2.2cm. Based on\n            our in-house lab data. Actual performance may vary.</p>\n        <p>*99% mop stain removal: Based on our in-house lab data. Actual performance may vary.</p>\n        <p>*100 days: Based on our in-house lab data. Actual performance may vary.</p>\n        <p>*The cleaning solution: To avoid potential damage, use our official cleaning solutions.</p>\n        <p>*45°C: Based on our in-house lab data. Actual performance may vary.</p>\n        <p>*30% faster charging: Based on our in-house lab data, compared to Dreame's robot vacuum models without fast\n            charging.</p>\n        <p>*Off-peak charging: Vary by region. Please set and adjust according to local conditions.</p>\n        <p>*Pet snaps: To protect your privacy, the recognition algorithm runs exclusively on the robot vacuum, with no\n            image data stored in the cloud.</p>\n        <p>*Low water level mopping: Available under CleanGenius Mode in the cleaning app. Choose from slightly dry (5),\n            moist (16), wet (27).</p>\n        <p>*Videos and images not stored in the cloud: For specific model capacities, please check product details or\n            contact customer service.</p>\n        <p>*Languages: Available through an upcoming OTA update. Please stay tuned.</p>\n        <p>*Specified area cleaning: Available in select regions.</p>\n        <p>*Matter protocol: Available through an upcoming OTA update. Please stay tuned.</p>\n        <p>*Alexa, Siri, and the Google Assistant: The third-party service requires a device that integrates voice\n            technology.</p>\n    </div>\n</div>",
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0
      }
    },
